 157:../src/middleware/mcc_tcpip_lite/rtcc.c **** 
 158:../src/middleware/mcc_tcpip_lite/rtcc.c ****   Returns:
 159:../src/middleware/mcc_tcpip_lite/rtcc.c ****     time_t value of the current time.
 160:../src/middleware/mcc_tcpip_lite/rtcc.c **** 
 161:../src/middleware/mcc_tcpip_lite/rtcc.c ****   Remarks:
 162:../src/middleware/mcc_tcpip_lite/rtcc.c ****     This function is a prerequisit to supporting the standard C time libraries.
 163:../src/middleware/mcc_tcpip_lite/rtcc.c ****   ***************************************************************************/
